{
  "description": "Two maps of objects and an object whose attribute lacks one of theirs unify to the object type",
  "spec": [
    "spec.md#type-unification",
    "spec.md#collection-and-structural-type-conversions",
    "ext/typeexpr/README.md#the-convert-cty-function"
  ],
  "op": "eval",
  "features": [
    "typed-values",
    "functions",
    "type-expressions"
  ],
  "notes": "The spec prefers the object type, and each map converts to it, dropping q. hashicorp/hcl gets the same result another way: it can't convert the object's attribute a, an object without q, to the maps' element type, which has q (go-cty doesn't fill a missing attribute with null as the spec does), and in go-cty the maps' element type and that attribute's type don't unify (objects with different attributes unify only to a map, and string and a list of strings have no common type), so unifyObjectsAsMaps in cty/convert/unify.go fails, and unify ranks the maps first and then takes the object type.",
  "variables": {
    "m": {
      "map": {
        "a": {
          "object": {
            "p": {
              "string": "x"
            },
            "q": {
              "list": [
                {
                  "string": "y"
                }
              ],
              "element_type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "element_type": [
        "object",
        {
          "p": "string",
          "q": [
            "list",
            "string"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "functions": {
    "convert": {
      "extension": "convert"
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "valid": true,
    "body": {
      "attributes": {
        "a": {
          "list": [
            {
              "object": {
                "a": {
                  "object": {
                    "p": {
                      "string": "x"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "object": {
                "a": {
                  "object": {
                    "p": {
                      "string": "x"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "object": {
                "a": {
                  "object": {
                    "p": {
                      "string": "z"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "element_type": [
            "object",
            {
              "a": [
                "object",
                {
                  "p": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "blocks": []
    }
  }
}
